{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rusty Robot Wants to Cry",
    "steam_appid": 2484460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/9fb60457f3de2d1f63929997cf8eb7cd.poster.avif?t=1720453268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/9fb60457f3de2d1f63929997cf8eb7cd.webm?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/9fb60457f3de2d1f63929997cf8eb7cd.mp4?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game &quot;Rusty Robot Wants to Cry&quot; has evolved into the new game &quot;Coin-Op VICE&quot;. All levels from &quot;Rusty Robot Wants to Cry&quot; are preserved. Now they can be played on the arcade machines of the large gaming center. A detective from the 80s arrives at a huge arcade center damaged by a cosmic beam. Crowds of visitors have turned into monsters, and arcade machines are running unusual versions of legendary games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/205d8947583b6eafa8f0c03645c00959.poster.avif?t=1720453268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/205d8947583b6eafa8f0c03645c00959.webm?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/205d8947583b6eafa8f0c03645c00959.mp4?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game has become more complex. The storyline has changed as well. Therefore, I have decided to change the project's name. I would appreciate it if you could visit the Coin-Op VICE game page and consider adding it to your wishlist.<br><br><br><br>The project under the name &quot;Rusty Robot Wants to Cry&quot; is closing. Thank you very much to everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/caf4c48a60e84db027f8fb335a107651.poster.avif?t=1720453268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/caf4c48a60e84db027f8fb335a107651.webm?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/caf4c48a60e84db027f8fb335a107651.mp4?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/9fb60457f3de2d1f63929997cf8eb7cd.poster.avif?t=1720453268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/9fb60457f3de2d1f63929997cf8eb7cd.webm?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/9fb60457f3de2d1f63929997cf8eb7cd.mp4?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game &quot;Rusty Robot Wants to Cry&quot; has evolved into the new game &quot;Coin-Op VICE&quot;. All levels from &quot;Rusty Robot Wants to Cry&quot; are preserved. Now they can be played on the arcade machines of the large gaming center. A detective from the 80s arrives at a huge arcade center damaged by a cosmic beam. Crowds of visitors have turned into monsters, and arcade machines are running unusual versions of legendary games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/205d8947583b6eafa8f0c03645c00959.poster.avif?t=1720453268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/205d8947583b6eafa8f0c03645c00959.webm?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/205d8947583b6eafa8f0c03645c00959.mp4?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game has become more complex. The storyline has changed as well. Therefore, I have decided to change the project's name. I would appreciate it if you could visit the Coin-Op VICE game page and consider adding it to your wishlist.<br><br><br><br>The project under the name &quot;Rusty Robot Wants to Cry&quot; is closing. Thank you very much to everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/caf4c48a60e84db027f8fb335a107651.poster.avif?t=1720453268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/caf4c48a60e84db027f8fb335a107651.webm?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484460/extras/caf4c48a60e84db027f8fb335a107651.mp4?t=1720453268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the world of retro-games as a roller robot. From platformers to the legendary Arkanoid, Xonix, Digger and Snake. Jump across platforms and fight glitch bosses. Colorful graphics, effects galore, and chiptune music. Anyone but a robot would cry from nostalgia!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
